<title>FRANCE: COB has no comment on any UAP probe.</title>
<headline>COB has no comment on any UAP probe.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French stock market watchdog COB said it had no comment on reports it had started a probe into trading in shares in insurer UAP before Tuesday's announcement of a share-swap offer by AXA.</p>
<p>&quot;We never comment on such reports,&quot; a COB spokesman said.</p>
<p>UAP shares closed 6.27 percent higher at 116.90 francs on Friday ahead of the weekend during which the deal was finalised. The Paris stock exchange was closed on Monday for Armistice day.</p>
<p>AXA said on Tuesday it would offer four of its shares, plus four value guarantee certificates, for 10 UAP shares.</p>
</text>
